{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26102","headline":"鸣鴈行 · 鲍溶","name":"鸣鴈行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七月朔方鴈心苦，联影翻空落南土。\n八月江南阴复晴，浮云绕天难夜行。\n羽翼劳痛心虚惊，一声相呼百处鸣。\n楚童夜宿烟波侧，沙上布罗连草色。\n月闇风悲欲下天，不知何处容栖息？\n楚童胡爲伤我神，尔不曾作远行人。\n江南羽族本不少，宁得网罗此客鸟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}